> @mgehre-amd please keep all your changes confined to `gfx11/Strix Halo`. Right now it is affecting all GPU archs, even the instinct.

@tjtanaa, `cache_aliasing_pad_elems` uses 
```CACHE_ALIASING_GEOMETRY: dict[str, tuple[int, int]] = {
    "gfx11": (2048, 128),
}
```
(https://github.com/ROCm/vllm/blob/2dae1c74b97702aa81a9be17185b90b5b0079bbe/vllm/model_executor/layers/utils.py#L265-L267)

so it only applies padding on gfx11 and keeps all others archs unchanged.
